# Code owners of the delivery path (GitLab Premium or Ultimate). With "Code owner approval"
# required on the protected branch main, a merge request that changes any file below needs
# an approval from the release managers before it can merge: these files decide what
# reaches staging and production (the pipeline, the agents' access, the deploy script, the
# chart and the environments' values).
#
# @platform/release-managers is a placeholder: replace it with your release managers'
# group (the people allowed to deploy the protected environment "production") before
# turning the rule on. docs/operator-guide.md, "Continuous delivery" > "Who can deploy".
#
# [Delivery][1]: one approval from the section's owners for every path in it; /deploy/
# covers the Helm chart (deploy/helm/), the environments' values and the agents' RBAC.
[Delivery][1] @platform/release-managers
/.gitlab-ci.yml
/.gitlab/CODEOWNERS
/.gitlab/agents/
/.github/
/scripts/deploy*
/scripts/lib/
/deploy/
